      "publisher": "Bundesanstalt für Finanzdienstleistungsaufsicht (BaFin), warnings and measures",
      "endpoint": "https://www.bafin.de/",
      "scope": "Warnings on unauthorised business and published measures and sanctions from BaFin's RSS feeds on or after 2025-01-01; named companies are source strings extracted by the declared title patterns, never attributed to an entity without a reviewed match; RSS is never a complete listing (operator must verify the feed URLs)",
      "license": {
        "id": "bafin-website-terms",
